5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know exactly how much we'll spend! I'll check the all-in rates and the offshore house pricing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm tired of wasting days on the road. I'll look into the ferry and train times, and how we get around by bus.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair way to handle the money. I'll check the separately booked room costs and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I hate being cramped and rushed. I'm looking into bathing hours and the inn mealtimes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand our group dynamic. I'll check the time alone in the shared house and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
