30,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is cheap per person, but all-in rates mean light eaters pay as much as big eaters.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two whole days for travel. The train to the valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Separate rooms last time had huge price differences. A single bill for a whole building is much fairer.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be on futons in one room. The island house has one cold bathroom.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Last year we barely saw each other. A shared house left us with zero privacy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the island house is one bill, does that solve the pricing problem?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if we want to actually spend time together, the city break sounds like a disaster.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, yes, a single building bill divides evenly, which is the most logical way to avoid disputes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, I can't do one room with everyone. I need a door or at least some space.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the city break offers the most privacy, but as Shunichi said, we might drift apart.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just don't want any surprises. The island seems cheapest, but the food is extra.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The city is the most efficient for movement, but the valley is a good middle ground for travel time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The city beds are expensive and vary wildly. I strongly dislike that uncertainty.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The valley inn sounds too rigid with the schedules. I'll feel trapped.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We need a balance. The island forces us together, but the shared house was too much.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
