55,3,1,talk,Rin,,I like the island because the house cost is clear and low. I vote A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I can't waste two days on a ferry. The valley is fast and easy. I vote B.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The island's single bill is the only fair way to handle the money. I vote A.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,I can't stand the thought of one bathroom or one big room. I vote C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The city is too lonely, and the island is too crowded. The valley is the compromise. I vote B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, but the city is so expensive!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, is a fair bill worth losing two days of the holiday to a boat?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, yes, because financial resentment lasts longer than a long boat ride.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I'd rather pay more than be miserable in a cold bathroom.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the valley has a public bath and more space than a single house.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,Maybe the valley is okay if the price is fixed?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,It's a set rate with meals. Very predictable.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'm still leaning toward the island for the billing simplicity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm sticking with the city. I need my own room.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I'm sticking with the valley. It's the best balance for the group.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Rin,,I'll switch to the valley to be with everyone. I vote B.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
